{
  "id": "638",
  "title": "The Snoring Story",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-01-16",
  "synopsis": "The husband has a good bedtime story for falling asleep.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/927/e9c333576b5b7699a6dd476a36badc31d78b2224.mp3?1545038571",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "打呼噜\n\n    一天晚上，我睡不着。我对睡在旁边的老公说：“老公，我睡不着。你给我讲个故事吧！”\n    老公说：“我不会讲故事。”\n    我说：“没关系，你讲什么故事都可以。”\n    老公想了想，对我说：“那我给你讲个打呼噜的故事吧！”\n    我同意了。\n    老公开始讲：“呼噜……呼噜……”\n    不一会儿，没有声音了。我转头一看，老公已经睡着了。",
    "traditional": "打呼嚕\n\n    一天晚上，我睡不著。我對睡在旁邊的老公說：“老公，我睡不著。你給我講個故事吧！”\n    老公說：“我不會講故事。”\n    我說：“沒關係，你講什麼故事都可以。”\n    老公想了想，對我說：“那我給你講個打呼嚕的故事吧！”\n    我同意了。\n    老公開始講：“呼嚕……呼嚕……”\n    不一會兒，沒有聲音了。我轉頭一看，老公已經睡著了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Snoring"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天晚上，我睡不着。",
      "traditional": "一天晚上，我睡不著。",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān wǎn shang wǒ shuì bù zháo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "我对睡在旁边的老公说：“老公，我睡不着。你给我讲个故事吧！”",
      "traditional": "我對睡在旁邊的老公說：“老公，我睡不著。你給我講個故事吧！”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ duì shuì zài páng biān de lǎo gōng shuō lǎo gōng wǒ shuì bù zháo nǐ gěi wǒ jiǎng ge gù shi ba",
      "english": "One evening I couldn’t fall asleep."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I said to my husband who was sleeping next to me: “Husband, I can’t sleep. Tell me a story!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "老公说：“我不会讲故事。”",
      "traditional": "老公說：“我不會講故事。”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo gōng shuō wǒ bú huì jiǎng gù shi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "My husband said: “I can’t tell stories.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我说：“没关系，你讲什么故事都可以。”",
      "traditional": "我說：“沒關係，你講什麼故事都可以。”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ shuō méi guān xi nǐ jiǎng shén me gù shi dōu kě yǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I said: “That’s ok. Any story is fine.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "老公想了想，对我说：“那我给你讲个打呼噜的故事吧！”",
      "traditional": "老公想了想，對我說：“那我給你講個打呼嚕的故事吧！”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo gōng xiǎng le xiǎng duì wǒ shuō nà wǒ gěi nǐ jiǎng ge dǎ hū lu de gù shi ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "My husband thought for a while and said to me: “Then I’ll tell you a story of snoring!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "我同意了。",
      "traditional": "我同意了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ tóng yì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I agreed."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "老公开始讲：“呼噜……呼噜……”",
      "traditional": "老公開始講：“呼嚕……呼嚕……”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo gōng kāi shǐ jiǎng hū lu hū lu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "My husband began: “Snore… snore…”"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "不一会儿，没有声音了。我转头一看，老公已经睡着了。",
      "traditional": "不一會兒，沒有聲音了。我轉頭一看，老公已經睡著了。",
      "pinyin": "bù yí huì'r méi yǒu shēng yīn le wǒ zhuǎn tóu yí kàn lǎo gōng yǐ jīng shuì zháo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Before long, the sound disappeared. I turned over to look, and my husband had already fallen asleep."
    }
  ],
