      "Snoring",
      "",
      "One evening I couldn’t fall asleep.",
      "I said to my husband who was sleeping next to me: “Husband, I can’t sleep. Tell me a story!”",
      "",
      "My husband said: “I can’t tell stories.”",
      "",
      "I said: “That’s ok. Any story is fine.”",
      "",
      "My husband thought for a while and said to me: “Then I’ll tell you a story of snoring!”",
      "",
      "I agreed.",
      "",
      "My husband began: “Snore… snore…”",
      "",
      "Before long, the sound disappeared. I turned over to look, and my husband had already fallen asleep.",
